# Bvcklesmiggle

## Product
- Clothing brand site: catalog + articles + partnerships + admin CMS.
- No in-app payments; products link out to Shopee/Tokopedia.
- Admin under `/admin/*` requires `is_admin=true`.

## Versions
- PHP 8.3 (composer `^8.2`)
- Node.js 20 (Vite 5)
- Laravel 11, Blade, Vite, Tailwind 3, MySQL in production

## Deploy
- Dokploy builds root `Dockerfile`. Entrypoint `setup.sh` runs migrate/optimize then php-fpm + nginx.
- Port 80, health `/up`. Set `APP_KEY`, `DB_*`, and `APP_URL=https://your-domain` (or `FORCE_HTTPS=true`) so assets are not served as http behind TLS.

## Code
- Follow existing controller/middleware/Blade patterns.
- Use `HtmlSanitizer` for rich text. Keep uploads on public disk + `storage:link`.
- Do not add payment gateways, Horizon, or scheduler workers unless requested.
